</table> <p style="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">Proposal 2 - Approval of an adjournment of the Special Meeting, if necessary, to solicit additional proxies if there are not sufficient votes at the time of the Special Meeting to approve Proposal 1. </p> <p style="font-size:12pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&#160;</p>
